<rich_text scale="h1" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">AI Red Team Flow</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>COAE is a 7-day AI red-team exam built with Google (aligned to SAIF): you assess an AI-driven environment (an AI app, an MCP server and separate ML challenges), then submit a commercial-grade report. It covers adversarial ML, prompt injection, LLM output exploitation, AI app/system security, privacy and defense.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
