<node name="Exam" unique_id="259" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="#867be5" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h1" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Your workspace for exam days: targets, findings, flags and a log for each day. Every table here matches a part of the </rich_text>
<rich_text link="webs https://docs.sysreptor.com/assets/reports/HTB-COAE-Report.pdf" foreground="#867be5">official COAE report template</rich_text>
<rich_text>, so by the end most of the report is already written down.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#e03131">Keep this file private
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Once you start the exam, this file holds exam content. Don't push it to a public GitHub repo or share it, during or after the exam. HTB's terms don't allow it. To lock it with a password, use </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Save As</rich_text>
<rich_text> and pick a </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Password Protected</rich_text>
<rich_text> storage type (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#867be5">.ctx</rich_text>
<rich_text> or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#867be5">.ctz</rich_text>
<rich_text>).</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Start here</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>1. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 260" foreground="#867be5">01 - Before You Start</rich_text>
<rich_text>: go through the checklist before you start.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>2. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 261" foreground="#867be5">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>: copy the scope from the letter of engagement.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>3. Keep a log as you work: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Log</rich_text>
<rich_text> has one node per exam day, from </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 267" foreground="#867be5">Day 01</rich_text>
<rich_text> to </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 273" foreground="#867be5">Day 07</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>One node per item under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>. Start with </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 265" foreground="#867be5">Target 1</rich_text>
<rich_text> and rename it. For each new one, duplicate </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › Target</rich_text>
<rich_text> (</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Tree › Duplicate Node</rich_text>
<rich_text>) and drag the copy under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Tracking</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 262" foreground="#867be5">03 - Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every vulnerability worth reporting. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Summary of Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 263" foreground="#867be5">04 - Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>: every flag and where it came from. Report: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">Flags Discovered</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#867be5">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<encoded_png char_offset="0" justification="left" link=""></encoded_png>
<node name="01 - Before You Start" unique_id="260" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="coae exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Setup</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>VPN connects and you can reach the first target</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot tool ready (Flameshot or similar). Paste each screenshot straight into the host's node with </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#867be5">Ctrl+V</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Screenshot names picked, like </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#867be5">web01-03-shell.png</rich_text>
<rich_text> (item, step, what it shows), so you can find each one when you write the report</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Terminal logging on (</rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#867be5">tmux</rich_text>
<rich_text> logging or </rich_text>
<rich_text family="monospace" foreground="#867be5">script</rich_text>
<rich_text>) so you keep every command and its output</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Report started from the HTB COAE template in SysReptor</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Autosave and backups on: </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">File › Preferences › Miscellaneous</rich_text>
<rich_text>, tick </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Autosave Every x Minutes</rich_text>
<rich_text> and </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Create a Backup Copy Before Saving</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>A copy of this file kept somewhere private. Only open it in one CherryTree window at a time, or you can lose changes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Read</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Letter of engagement read twice, scope copied into </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 261" foreground="#867be5">02 - Scope &amp; Rules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Exam start time, end time and report deadline written down</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>What counts as a flag and how to submit it</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Plan</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Rough plan for each day, with real breaks</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Sleep plan. Long exams are lost to fatigue more often than to missing skills.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Wordlists and tools ready on your attack box</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
