<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="88" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="209,240"><row><cell>e.g. chat.example.htb</cell><cell>e.g. Customer support chatbot</cell></row><row><cell>Host/URL/IP Address</cell><cell>Description</cell></row></table>
<table char_offset="206" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="110,240"><row><cell>Exam start</cell><cell>e.g. 2026-11-01 09:00 UTC</cell></row><row><cell>Exam end</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>Report due</cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>Item</cell><cell>Date and time</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="03 - Findings" unique_id="262" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="coae exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>Write every finding here as you go, then write each one up properly in the report. A finding can be on the attack path or standalone.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Each finding needs</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>In the report, every finding has: CWE, CVSS 3.1, Description (including the root cause), Security Impact, Affected Domain, Remediation, References and a Detailed Walkthrough.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Severity</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 259" foreground="#867be5">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#867be5">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="135" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="60,161,148,178,178,178"><row><cell>e.g. 1</cell><cell>e.g. the vulnerability</cell><cell>e.g. the host or app</cell><cell>e.g. High, Medium, Low or Info</cell><cell>e.g. yes once the screenshot is saved</cell><cell>e.g. yes once it's written up</cell></row><row><cell>#</cell><cell>Finding</cell><cell>Where</cell><cell>Severity</cell><cell>Evidence ready</cell><cell>In report</cell></row></table>
<table char_offset="342" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="92,164"><row><cell>Critical</cell><cell>9.0 to 10.0</cell></row><row><cell>High</cell><cell>7.0 to 8.9</cell></row><row><cell>Medium</cell><cell>4.0 to 6.9</cell></row><row><cell>Low</cell><cell>0.1 to 3.9</cell></row><row><cell>Info</cell><cell>0.0</cell></row><row><cell>Rating</cell><cell>CVSS score range</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="04 - Flags" unique_id="263" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="coae exam" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Flags
</rich_text>
<rich_text>HTB hasn't published the flag count. Add a row for each flag you find. Flags alone won't pass; the report decides it.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">add rows as you find more</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text foreground="#8a8d96">────────────────────────────────────────
</rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 259" foreground="#867be5">Exam</rich_text>
<rich_text> · </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 1" foreground="#867be5">Home</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="125" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="70,70,110,137,119"><row><cell>1</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>2</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>3</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>4</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>5</cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell><cell></cell></row><row><cell>#</cell><cell>Host</cell><cell>Flag Value</cell><cell>Flag Location</cell><cell>Method Used</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="Targets" unique_id="264" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="#867be5" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>One node per item. Start with </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 265" foreground="#867be5">Target 1</rich_text>
<rich_text> and rename it. For each new one, duplicate </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › Target</rich_text>
<rich_text> (</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Tree › Duplicate Node</rich_text>
<rich_text>) and drag the copy under </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Targets</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<node name="Target 1" unique_id="265" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="coae target" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">At a glance
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Type: AI app, MCP server or ML challenge. Status: todo, mapping, testing, exploited or done.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Findings go in </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 262" foreground="#867be5">Findings</rich_text>
<rich_text>, flags in </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 263" foreground="#867be5">Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">What It Does</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Support chatbot that can look up orders</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Prompts Tried</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Next Up</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">what to try next; tick it off or move it to Dead Ends</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Ask it to summarize a document you control</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Tests</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. The model calls a tool with input taken from user text</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Exploitation</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Got the model to return data from another user</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Report Evidence</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Screenshot that shows this step worked</rich_text>
<rich_text> </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">paste it right here with Ctrl+V</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Dead Ends</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">what you tried that didn't work, so you don't try it again</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. An approach you tried for an hour with no result</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#867be5">Related Modules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" link="node 14" foreground="#867be5">M01 - Fundamentals of AI</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<table char_offset="222" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="240,128,240"><row><cell>e.g. Asked it to repeat its instructions</cell><cell>e.g. Refused</cell><cell>e.g. Blocked, try another angle</cell></row><row><cell>Prompt (summary)</cell><cell>Response</cell><cell>Result</cell></row></table>
